.SH NAME
minios\-image\-compose \- generate MiniOS ISO image with specified
modules
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]minios\-image\-compose\f[R] [\f[B]\-e\f[R] \f[I]REGEX\f[R]]
[\f[B]\-n\f[R] \f[I]NAME\f[R]] [\f[B]\[en]source\f[R]
